fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"gl-egl/gstgldisplay_egl.html#gst_gl_display_egl_new","fragment":"\n\tgst_gl_display_egl_new\n\n\n\tGstGLEGL.GLDisplayEGL.prototype.new\n\n\n\tGstGLEGL.GLDisplayEGL.new\n\nCreate a new GstGLDisplayEGL using the default EGL_DEFAULT_DISPLAY.\nThe returned GstGLDisplayEGL will by default free all EGL resources when\nfinalized. See gst_gl_display_egl_set_foreign for details on if you need\nthe EGLDisplay to remain alive.\na new GstGLDisplayEGL or NULL\nCreate a new GstGLEGL.GLDisplayEGL using the default EGL_DEFAULT_DISPLAY.\nThe returned GstGLEGL.GLDisplayEGL will by default free all EGL resources when\nfinalized. See GstGLEGL.GLDisplayEGL.prototype.set_foreign for details on if you need\nthe EGLDisplay to remain alive.\na new GstGLEGL.GLDisplayEGL or null\nCreate a new GstGLEGL.GLDisplayEGL using the default EGL_DEFAULT_DISPLAY.\nThe returned GstGLEGL.GLDisplayEGL will by default free all EGL resources when\nfinalized. See GstGLEGL.GLDisplayEGL.set_foreign for details on if you need\nthe EGLDisplay to remain alive.\na new GstGLEGL.GLDisplayEGL or None\n"});